					<textElement>
						<font/>
					</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[We are sending you the following herbarium material as a gift. This is upon the understanding that you agree that it will be used for scientific purposes only and not for commercial use. Upon arrival of the consignment please verify the contents and kindly acknowledge receipt by signing the duplicate sheet and returning it to RBGE Herbarium. Many Thanks.]]></text>
